# Environment for the /devnet deployment ("staging-devnet") and local devnet runs.
#
# Loaded by `npm run build:devnet`, which sources this file before running
# `next build` with BASE_PATH=/devnet. Next.js does not auto-load `.env.devnet`,
# so the values below only take effect through that script. The same file is read
# by scripts/sdk-env.mjs, so `NETWORK=devnet node scripts/<script>.mjs` picks up
# the same wiring without repeating it on the command line.
#
# This file is checked in on purpose: contract IDs, identity IDs and node
# addresses are public data. Never put a seed phrase, WIF, or any other private
# key material here — those live in `.env.local` (gitignored) or GitHub secrets.
#
# SAKURA (Platform 5.0.0-beta.2, protocol 14, node network id
# dash-devnet-sakura). Sakura's PLATFORM chain was wiped for 5.0.0-beta.2 on
# 2026-10-06 (Core was kept), so every 2026-10-01 sakura id in git history is
# dead, as are all bonsia and moutai ids. Every identity was re-created from a
# new asset lock with the SAME keys (new ids), and every contract below is new.

NEXT_PUBLIC_NETWORK=devnet
# The SDK's devnetName is the node's network id suffix: plain `sakura`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEVNET_NAME=sakura

# All 13 validators, listed explicitly (seed-1..3.sakura… all resolve to one
# host). Each serves a Let's Encrypt IP-SAN certificate on :1443 (the current
# set expires 2026-10-11 and auto-renews).
NEXT_PUBLIC_DAPI_ADDRESSES=https://68.67.122.86:1443,https://68.67.122.87:1443,https://68.67.122.240:1443,https://68.67.122.241:1443,https://68.67.122.88:1443,https://68.67.122.89:1443,https://68.67.122.90:1443,https://68.67.122.91:1443,https://68.67.122.92:1443,https://68.67.122.93:1443,https://68.67.122.94:1443,https://68.67.122.95:1443,https://68.67.122.232:1443

# Quorum service for the trusted context (BLS public keys that verify read
# proofs). The SDK's name-derived default (quorums.sakura…) is the same host;
# it is set explicitly anyway.
NEXT_PUBLIC_QUORUM_URL=https://quorums.sakura.networks.dash.org

# Insight reports "network":"testnet" — devnets reuse testnet address and WIF
# prefixes, which is why key derivation stays on testnet (see keyNetwork()).
NEXT_PUBLIC_INSIGHT_API_URL=https://insight.sakura.networks.dash.org/insight-api

# Contracts on sakura, published 2026-10-06 by the maker (a new identity on a
# wiped chain, so contract ids are generateId(maker, nonce)). All ten are
# maker-owned and enrolled in ONE contract group,
# AEEpKL9ZhwGgGkKpmiwLPVsjM8zwpT6ELJXtkFa7P1Lq (DEVNET_CONTRACT_GROUP_ID below),
# registered on the social create at nonce 1. Sources, sha256-pinned: social v12
# (5b9cf0cc…, docs/SOCIAL_V12.md), blog v6 with D5 (c5a2c9cd…,
# docs/PLATFORM_V5_BETA1_UPGRADE.md), storefront v5, DM v4/v5 and pollr v4 from
# contracts/; key backup, key exchange, vault and auth vault from the testnet
# snapshot.
#
#   nonce 1  social v12       nonce 6  storefront v5 (embeds the social id)
#   nonce 2  key backup       nonce 7  blog v6 (embeds the social id)
#   nonce 3  key exchange     nonce 8  DM v4
#   nonce 4  vault            nonce 9  pollr v4
#   nonce 5  auth vault       nonce 10 DM v5
#
# Social v12 (docs/SOCIAL_V12.md) is v11 with the like author and hashtag
# indexes (and the reply-like author index) kept as one counter per post
# (summableOffCountIndex), and retractedWhen on post and reply, so a banned or
# suspended author can still tombstone its own writing.
# Social v11 (docs/SOCIAL_V11.md) is v10 plus: likes that outlive deletes (no
# like keeps its time; an unlike names no $createdAt), moderated posts and
# replies (an author TOMBSTONES; only moderators remove, keeping a record that
# moderatedDocument references resolve to), preallocated like trees paid by the
# post, removal records that keep hashtag/$createdAt, and settled deletion:
# one moderator within 7 days, then the seated team (leader + 2). ELECTED
# moderation with 3600 s join/vote windows (owner interim, ownerProtected);
# election E1 (charter 6kiTPiturzSefwfV5fpwth5juakNpc64txMbBWQ6RFP3) seats
# tess1999 with alice7 and battery bot 1, both elected through join requests
# (a leader-added member would not count for older posts, platform#5260). There is NO
# profile contract: the base profile is DashPay's `profile` (system contract
# Bwr4WHCPz5rFVAD87RqTs3izo4zpzwsEdKPWUT1NS1C7) and the social `yapprProfile`
# type is the extension.
#
# YAPP (social token position 0) is 9Dk2zA32FDtDLxbTotedhV5rmVEEErkkqYHtaG3ChZxg.
# It starts paused and can never be unpaused or priced: transfers are refused
# (40711) and direct purchases are refused (40721). Identities claim the
# 100-YAPP once-per-identity grant; the maker mints anything beyond it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_CONTRACT_ID=78osKsoZq4X5AyRSn9C9fb92oHQ172qEUFw8Q1v6hS5G
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_TOPOLOGY=v12

# Social v13 template (docs/SOCIAL_V13.md): NOT registered on sakura yet. To
# cut /devnet over, register social v13 and the blocks contract
# (contracts/yappr-blocks-contract.json) with scripts/register-feature-contract.mjs,
# then replace the two lines above with these, filled in, and set the blocks
# contract id. Block, blockFilter and blockFollow live in the blocks contract on
# v13; a v13 build without NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_BLOCKS_CONTRACT_ID blocks nobody.
# The feature contracts that embed the social id (storefront, blog) need re-cuts
# against the new id too.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_CONTRACT_ID=<social v13 id>
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_TOPOLOGY=v13
# NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_BLOCKS_CONTRACT_ID=<blocks contract id>

# Optional feature contracts, maker-owned and in the same group as social;
# their *_TOPOLOGY gates below must match. Blank an id to turn the feature off:
# services fail closed instead of querying a missing contract.
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_DM_CONTRACT_ID=524SSp62bNepp3Twi4haMwx5F66deDP1kQFqUx3cwqpF
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_STOREFRONT_CONTRACT_ID=BQ8scEEDkLnmszu1JT5vFPkE2ppHhHiufSdYU6s7pEp3
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENCRYPTED_KEY_BACKUP_CONTRACT_ID=ABQquoabTMDgQfCwzNU8zzeZKqiTRSXuNAqiRarhWSDT
NEXT_PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGE_CONTRACT_ID=72KngCJcWg3EFcGTuofX4C8vkUZeZ1H2eL9EHHehGNBU
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_VAULT_CONTRACT_ID=6DkcKegt1iMtNzykqUbsJxfNhQZy3B3JqLhsGh3DiVXZ
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_AUTH_VAULT_CONTRACT_ID=BNZ2g3eMcBuXFPWTohdJ5uX5qiTMNaR36QG2B4i3PrHK
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_BLOG_CONTRACT_ID=z6vieQYH3iiGaYxSnRpW44i5MnckSkuYtEvzhNCCCfV
NEXT_PUBLIC_POLLR_CONTRACT_ID=7VB2hBnAa8835BM7KqEtdNxxFpGF17JWey3FnLadqb18

# DM v5 (docs/DM_V5.md): unlinkable 1:1 and group messaging. Every new
# conversation goes here; the DM v4 contract above is read-only and its threads
# merge into the v5 timeline.
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPPR_DM_V5_CONTRACT_ID=6BXefMngy7hP72dCvrzqDeybUk3k5kbqNHTCioeYGAtD

# Feature topology gates, each pinned to the contract registered above. Blog
# v6 (D5): a comment derives its post's owner through blogPostId.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DM_TOPOLOGY=v5
NEXT_PUBLIC_STOREFRONT_TOPOLOGY=v5
NEXT_PUBLIC_BLOG_TOPOLOGY=v6
NEXT_PUBLIC_POLLR_TOPOLOGY=v4

# DPNS is a system contract and normally keeps the same id on every chain; set
# this only if the devnet registered it elsewhere.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DPNS_CONTRACT_ID=

# Maker: index 9 of the privately retained deployment seed (the same key as on
# bonsia and moutai, a new identity id on each sakura chain; nonce 10 after the
# 2026-10-06 publish).
# The dedicated CI seed is separate and cannot control the maker.
DEVNET_CONTRACT_GROUP_ID=AEEpKL9ZhwGgGkKpmiwLPVsjM8zwpT6ELJXtkFa7P1Lq
DEVNET_MAKER_IDENTITY_ID=GuNNAm7PZHKR67DKg1BbsivjPdEqHqV9Vr2e7KvPkhQM

# The devnet social contract is owned by the devnet maker, so token moderation
# (freeze/unfreeze/destroy, mint) gates on it instead of the testnet authority
# baked into lib/constants.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_YAPP_TOKEN_AUTHORITY_ID=GuNNAm7PZHKR67DKg1BbsivjPdEqHqV9Vr2e7KvPkhQM

# Dedicated CI bots, in derivation-index order of the E2E_DEVNET_SEED_PHRASE
# secret: index 0 is the CI identity (yappr-ci-devnet-260915), 1-8 the DM v5
# e2e bots (yappr-dm-e2e-1..8, each with the seed-derived ENCRYPTION key). Same
# keys as on bonsia, new ids after each sakura wipe. Testnet credentials are unchanged.
E2E_IDENTITY_IDS=7misd2AZpvZcrHZ2bh6TK8fi5WLg9i99Hp6esSZVU9ge,9vTCYyWTRAb5kmt6s9iyWjqmhj6Jy358JUU7T2nAnTH9,CKheqr85jgf21SEYDAsc3ka5zG9ADLq3nQqusxa6tcJH,733LbDaM3DAhP5LtembbihCNMdwSxTzha3o6YfoHyZX9,4GUrt3JdQzPq5ktUifq9vp4Wx1NKgR9SeGX3NKUEp2vD,GR7YgRDjeeGvAkMon92L4doa6CDix2at9ZUmEPXnhZ7r,7Ww7ehrLMqUWLX3USeJux487nvubaTzsoGfxmUPnVpXk,9RU9PpFcFizd2j4EHHwD7NTf4GKZNsEuAW3gSGWmkYd5,9abvuj4nnbWGg5ZzTaZ8dQR2xUMAVhCfoHDM24frmXQj

NEXT_PUBLIC_LOG_LEVEL=debug
